#: ../../source/legacy/production/performance_tuning.rst:15
msgid "Minimum Retrieve Tokens"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/legacy/production/performance_tuning.rst:17
msgid ""
"When LMCache finds a partial KV cache hit, it loads the cached tokens "
"into GPU memory to avoid recomputation. However, if only a small number "
"of tokens are hit, the overhead of loading them from the cache may "
"outweigh the benefit of skipping recomputation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/legacy/production/performance_tuning.rst:22
msgid ""
"The ``min_retrieve_tokens`` setting lets you set a threshold: if the "
"number of tokens that need to be loaded is below this value, LMCache will"
" skip the retrieve and let the inference engine recompute them instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/legacy/production/performance_tuning.rst:29
msgid ""
"Even when retrieve is skipped, LMCache still records the hit tokens "
"internally so that it does **not** re-store chunks that already exist in "
"the cache."
msgstr ""

